{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfjE8ANYnrpa1tTa9HvFh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Candidate 5 passes the admission check (`OK`, ELPD-LOO −2097.5 on the smoke fit). That number comes from a 100-draw single-chain fit, so it can't be compared with the full-fit scores (incumbent −2103.4).\n\n**What I refined:** `face_biased_second_order_motif` (rank 2, tied with the best), renamed **`face_specific_streak_chance_coin`**.\n\n**The one change:** I moved the coin's heads/tails asymmetry from the head count to repeats. People are taken to believe chance repeats tails more readily than heads. So a heads-heads repeat counts as more evidence against chance than a tails-tails repeat. In the model, one shared parameter `rho` multiplies the difference between the two sequences in (tails-tails repeats − heads-heads repeats). This replaces the old model's head-count term.\n\n**Why:**\n- The critique's one finding that survives the FDR correction is that people choose the sequence with more heads less often than a heads/tails-symmetric model predicts.\n- I checked which way of placing that asymmetry fits better, by adding one term at a time on top of the incumbent's fitted predictions. The repeat-based term gained 3.7 nats; the head-count term gained 3.0.\n- Other cues gained little: where a streak sits, the first or last flip, perfect alternation, period-3 motifs.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- The smoke fit flagged PSIS-LOO as unreliable (6.5% of trials with Pareto k > 0.5). That is plausible with only 100 draws, but whether the full admission fit is reliable and converges is untested.\n- Novelty against the live models isn't tested either. The new term is small, about 0.04 on the log-odds scale per repeat, so its predictions may sit close to the face-bias models'.\n- The other slots refining the incumbent this round may add a similar heads/tails term to it.\n\nThe three files are in `iter_4/candidate_5/`: `hypothesis.md`, `model_name.txt` and `candidate.py`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248,"cache_read_input_tokens":115864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":248,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":675,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01ad7ff8-3f66-4531-a811-60d8447f5a47","uuid":"4bef2b40-1d98-490b-8811-13469f45a1ed","timestamp":"2026-10-05T14:12:36.850Z","request_id":"req_011CfjE89uGvUECvbJqBKMSf"}
